-- Phase 3 of the NPC / bestiary work, sixth book: every species in Rifts World
-- Book 18: Mystic Russia's bestiary (printed 19-71) - its eighteen demons and its
-- eight Woodland Spirits - rows for creatures (migration 074) and their attacks
-- in stat_attacks (owner_kind 'creature').
--
-- One-off data script, run once per environment. NOT a migration.
--
-- The six Woodland Spirits the book lets a G.M. allow as player characters
-- (Domovoi, Leshii, Polevoi, Vodianoi, Spirit Wolf, Man-Wolf) are already
-- published classes (Mystic Russia survey, batch 3); these creature rows are the
-- NPC view of them, and the Rusalka too. The Firebird is the book's one flat no.
-- Every demon is an NPC; the Serpent Hound is the one whose heading carries no
-- NPC tag.
--
-- NOT HERE: Old Man Morozko, King of the Frost Demons, an individual for
-- notable_npcs, not imported yet; the Werebeasts and Vampires, which the book
-- only points to other books for.
--
-- A RIFTS BOOK: an M.D.C. creature's pool is its M.D.C.; the "on S.D.C. worlds"
-- figures and the night-time increases are in pools_note.
--
-- EXTRACTED by three book-extract-workers, each given the NAMES of its species,
-- every number read off a 200 dpi render rather than the OCR cache, which carries
-- the digit cipher. RECONCILED by book-reconcile against the renders, row by
-- row; its corrections are applied. Every row passes creatureFormulaGaps, the
-- grammar the endpoint rolls with. description and natural_abilities are short
-- paraphrases - no sentence is the book's.
--
--   node scripts/d1-apply.mjs --local apps/character-creator/db/add-creatures-mystic-russia.sql
--
-- BY CATEGORY:
--   demon (18): The Unclean Demon, The Demon Claw, The Hell Horse Demon, The Il'ya
--     Demon, The Kaluga Hag, Kladovik Guardian Demon, The Midnight Demon, The Nalet,
--     Serpent Hound, Stone Demon, Water Demon, Wood Demon, Khitaka Abductors, The
--     Nightfeeder, Koshchei the Deathless Ones, Morozko Frost Demons, Whirlwind Air
--     Demons, Wolf-Serpent
--   spirit (8): Domovoi, Leshii, Polevoi, Rusalka, Vodianoi, Firebird, Spirit Wolf,
--     Man-Wolf

  'unclean-demon', 'The Unclean Demon', 'demon', 'rifts', 0, 'Always miscreant or diabolic', '{"IQ":"1D4+6","ME":"1D6+6","MA":"1D6+6","PS":"2D6+12","PP":"2D6+10","PE":"2D6+10","PB":"1D6","Spd":"2D6+18"}', NULL, NULL, 'PE+2D4x10+8', '3D4x10+PE', NULL, 'Race Lesser Archaic Demon. Also Known as Unclean Spirits or Unclean Force. P.S. is half in daylight. Minimum speed 22 (15 mph/24 km). M.D.C. increases 50 percent at night/darkness. On S.D.C. worlds: 1D6x10+PE Hit Points, 1D4x10 S.D.C., both +50 percent at night; A.R. 11 (13 at night). H.F. 12 for a pack of four or more.', NULL, 9, '{"attacks":4,"initiative":3,"strike":3,"parry":2,"dodge":1,"pull":4,"roll":3}', '+2 to save vs Horror Factor, in addition to attribute bonuses. Supernatural P.S.', 'Horsemanship (exotic animals); land navigation 80 percent; wilderness survival 90 percent; plus 3 skills from each of W.P. Ancient Weapons, Rogue, and Espionage, all +15 percent (one skill +10 percent more); these skills do not advance', 'Runs untiring for hours, leaps 15 ft, climbs, swims, tracks by scent and sight, holds its breath, dimensionally teleports, bio-regenerates, understands all languages, rides storm winds in flight, and disguises itself as a black cat, pig, wolf, or rat.', 'Fools Gold, Multiple Image, Levitate, Mask of Deceit, Repel Animals, Compulsion, Spoil (Food/Water), Sickness, Shadow Meld, Cloak of Darkness; potency equal to a 3rd level sorcerer', NULL, '4-5 feet (1.2 to 1.5 m) tall', '100-150 pounds (45 to 67.5 kg)', 'Uncertain, 1000+ years; may be immortal', 'Woodlands (especially deep forests and swamps), ruins, abandoned buildings, slums, waste dump sites, caves, and subterranean networks throughout Rifts Russia, China, and much of Asia', 'Others of its kind; greater demons; powerful practitioners of magic; other powerful beings with agendas of murder, torture, and mayhem', 'All mortals, particularly humans; Gargoyles; Brodkil', NULL, 'A satyr-like lesser demon with goat legs and horns that hides by day, disguises itself as animals, and terrorizes travelers and villages by night.', 'Rifts World Book 18: Mystic Russia p.19-20');
  'demon-claw', 'The Demon Claw', 'demon', 'rifts', 0, 'Always miscreant or diabolic', '{"IQ":"1D4+5","ME":"1D6+2","MA":"1D6+2","PS":"5D6+23","PP":"2D6+12","PE":"2D6+12","PB":"1D4","Spd":"2D6+28"}', NULL, NULL, 'PEx3+160', '2D4x10+PE', NULL, 'Race Lesser Archaic Demon. Also Known as the Hand of Evil and Claw of Death. Main Body M.D.C. is P.E. number x3 plus an additional 160 points, +50 percent when on a ley line. Each of the four legs has 100 M.D.C. (90 S.D.C.), the large claw hands 70 M.D.C. (60 S.D.C.) each. Spd is running or swimming; minimum speed 30 (20 mph/32 km). On S.D.C. worlds: 1D6x10+PE Hit Points, 2D6x10 S.D.C., both +50 percent at ley lines/places of magic; A.R. 16.', NULL, 14, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":3,"strike":3,"parry":5,"dodge":2,"pull":2,"roll":2}', '+10 to save vs Horror Factor. Supernatural P.S. and P.E.', 'Land navigation 80 percent; wilderness survival 90 percent; plus 3 skills from the Wilderness skill category, all +5 percent', 'Runs, fights, or swims 24 hours without tiring, leaps 15 ft, climbs, swims fast, runs on water, floats, breathes underwater indefinitely, tracks by scent, dimensionally teleports, bio-regenerates M.D., and regrows lost limbs.', 'Float in Air, Levitate, Chameleon, Fear, Fire Bolt, Fire Ball, Agony, Spoil (Water only); potency equal to a 2nd level sorcerer', NULL, '7-8 feet (2.1 to 2.4 m) tall, 7 feet (2.1 m) long, 12 feet (3.6 m) wide', '1200 pounds (540 kg)', 'Uncertain, 1000+ years; probably immortal', 'Typically in or near swamps and other bodies of water, especially if polluted; found throughout Rifts Russia, China, and much of Asia', 'Others of its kind; greater demons; powerful practitioners of magic; other powerful beings with agendas of war, murder, torture, and mayhem', 'All mortals, particularly humans; Gargoyles; Brodkil; Aquatics (demons)', NULL, 'A crab-shaped demon encased in bony armor with four blade-tipped legs and massive claw hands, a solitary swamp predator that also guards for stronger demons.', 'Rifts World Book 18: Mystic Russia p.21-22');
  'hell-horse-demon', 'The Hell Horse Demon', 'demon', 'rifts', 0, 'Always miscreant or diabolic', '{"IQ":"1D4+3","ME":"1D6+4","MA":"1D6","PS":"3D6+22","PP":"2D6+16","PE":"2D6+12","PB":"1D6","Spd":"2D6x10+100"}', NULL, NULL, 'PE+2D6x10+30', '2D6x10+ME', NULL, 'Race A lesser demon. Also Known as Chertu Baran, Devils Mount, and Demon Horse. M.D.C. doubles during ley line storms. Spd is running (2D6x10+100, min 80 mph/128.7 km); flying speed is 220 (150 mph/241 km maximum), doubled along ley lines. Can pull or carry 600 times its P.S. in pounds. H.F. 12 for a pack of four or more. On S.D.C. worlds: 1D6x10+PE Hit Points, 1D6x10 S.D.C.; A.R. 12.', NULL, 10, '{"attacks":4,"initiative":4,"strike":2,"dodge":5,"pull":1,"roll":3}', '+5 to auto-dodge (does not use a melee attack/action, rolled on 1D20); +1 to save vs magic; +4 to save vs Horror Factor. Supernatural P.S.', 'Land navigation 90 percent; wilderness survival 90 percent; herd cattle 85 percent; plus 2 skills from each of Espionage and Wilderness, all +10 percent', 'Superhuman ground and flying speed, hovers, runs 24 hours untiring, leaps far, swims, dimensionally teleports, bio-regenerates M.D., can become a bolt of lightning to travel instantly, and disguises itself as an ordinary horse.', NULL, NULL, 'About the size of a normal horse, 6 feet (1.8 m) tall at the shoulders', '1500 pounds (675 kg)', 'Uncertain, 1000+ years; probably immortal', 'Woodlands, the Steppe, grasslands, and mountain regions throughout Rifts Russia, China, and much of Asia; usually with a master or riders, in pairs or groups of 1D4+2', 'Other Archaic demons; others of its own kind; greater demons; dark gods; high level Necromancers and Witches; other diabolical practitioners of magic', 'All mortals, particularly humans; Gargoyles; Brodkil; Deevils (though sometimes forced to serve them)', NULL, 'A skeletal, ghostly white demon horse of tremendous speed that carries demons into battle and serves as a mount for evil masters.', 'Rifts World Book 18: Mystic Russia p.22-24');
  'ilya-demon', 'The Il''ya Demon', 'demon', 'rifts', 0, 'Anarchist (20 percent), miscreant (50 percent), or diabolic (30 percent)', '{"IQ":"1D6+8","ME":"1D6+8","MA":"1D6+8","PS":"2D6+14","PP":"2D6+8","PE":"2D6+8","PB":"1D6","Spd":"3D6+30"}', NULL, NULL, 'PE+1D6x10+14', '3D4x10+PE', NULL, 'Race Lesser Archaic Demon (printed as Il''ya Demon; also known as Storm Demons). P.B. is 1D6 as a demon, 2D6+6 in metamorphed animal or human form. Spd is +30 in animal form; flying (only in demon form) is 1D6x10+40. M.D.C. increases 50 percent at night. On S.D.C. worlds: 1D4x10+PE Hit Points, 1D4x10 S.D.C., both +50 percent at night; A.R. 10 (12 at night).', NULL, 9, '{"attacks":4,"initiative":3,"strike":3,"parry":2,"dodge":2,"pull":2,"roll":3}', '+4 to save vs Horror Factor. Supernatural P.S.', 'Horsemanship (exotic animals); land navigation 75 percent; wilderness survival 75 percent; plus 3 skills from each of W.P. Ancient Weapons, Rogue, and Domestic, all +15 percent (one skill +10 percent more)', 'Runs and flies for hours untiring, leaps, climbs, swims, holds its breath, tracks by scent, dimensionally teleports, bio-regenerates, rides storm winds in flight, and shapeshifts into the animal type matching its demon head.', 'Thunderclap, Heavy Breathing, Fingers of Wind, Float in Air, Wind Rush, Compulsion, Spoil (Food/Water), Sickness, Minor Curse, Call Lightning, Electric Arc, Influence the Beast; potency equal to a 2nd level sorcerer', NULL, '3-5 feet (0.9 to 1.5 m) tall; average around 4 ft (1.2 m)', '100-150 pounds (45 to 67.5 kg)', 'Uncertain, 1000+ years; probably immortal', 'Woodlands, ruins, abandoned buildings, slums, waste dump sites, caves, and subterranean networks throughout Rifts Russia, China, and much of Asia; many live disguised among humans', 'Others of its kind; other demons; greater demons; powerful practitioners of magic', 'All mortals, particularly humans; Gargoyles; Brodkil', NULL, 'A small hunchbacked demon with an animal head and small wings that appears during storms and disguises itself as an animal or vagabond to prey on travelers and children.', 'Rifts World Book 18: Mystic Russia p.25-26');
  'kaluga-hag', 'The Kaluga Hag', 'demon', 'rifts', 0, 'Always miscreant or diabolic', '{"IQ":"2D6+6","ME":"1D6+10","MA":"2D6+10","PS":"2D6+22","PP":"2D6+10","PE":"2D6+10","PB":"1D6","Spd":"2D6+18"}', NULL, NULL, 'PE+3D6x10', '3D6x10+60', NULL, 'Race Lesser Demon, though some rank her among the greater demons. Also Known as Demon Hag or Witch Demon. Minimum speed 22 (15 mph/24 km). M.D.C. increases 30 percent at night. Twice per night can transform into a beautiful woman (P.B. 1D6+18) for one hour; poisonous tongue/kiss still applies. On S.D.C. worlds: 2D6x10+PE Hit Points, 1D6x10 S.D.C.; A.R. 10.', NULL, 12, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":3,"strike":4,"parry":2,"dodge":1,"pull":3,"roll":2}', '+6 to save vs Horror Factor. Supernatural P.S.', 'Horsemanship (exotic animals); land navigation 80 percent; wilderness survival 70 percent; identify plants, recognize poisons, and brewing all at 90 percent; plus 2 skills from each of W.P. Ancient Weapons, Domestic or Technical, and Rogue or Medical, all +20 percent (two skills +10 percent more)', 'Runs untiring for hours, leaps 15 ft, needs no air, eats poisoned food, climbs, prowls, identifies poisons and toxins, dimensionally teleports, bio-regenerates, and can turn into a beautiful woman twice nightly.', 'All Necromancy spells levels 1-12, plus Fly, Repel Animals, Fear, Trance, Calling, Domination, Compulsion, Agony, Life Drain, Negate Magic, Minor Curse, Luck Curse, Sickness, Spoil, Commune with Spirits, Negate Poisons/Toxins, Cure Minor Disorders, Cure Illness, plus Federation of Magic spells Cleanse, Watchguard, Forcebonds, Distant Voice, Instill Knowledge, Horror, Aura of Death, Aura of Doom, Aura of Power, Death Curse, Fortify Against Disease, and Plane Skip; potency equal to a 5th level Necromancer', NULL, '5-6 feet (1.5 to 1.8 m) tall', '100-180 pounds (45 to 55 kg) as printed', 'Uncertain, 1000+ years; probably immortal', 'Woodlands, ruins, abandoned buildings, slums, and strange or ugly places throughout Rifts Russia, China, and much of Asia; lives in a dilapidated hut, often near ley lines', 'Tends to be a loner; occasionally Necromancers, other demons, greater demons, and dark gods; human Witches and Necromancers', 'All mortals, particularly humans; Gargoyles; Brodkil', NULL, 'A withered, poisonous hag demon whose venomous tongue and acid pimples spread suffering, with Necromancer-level magic to subjugate entire villages.', 'Rifts World Book 18: Mystic Russia p.26-28');
  'kladovik-guardian-demon', 'Kladovik Guardian Demon', 'demon', 'rifts', 0, 'Always diabolic', '{"IQ":"1D6+4","ME":"1D6","MA":"1D6","PS":"3D6+24","PP":"2D6+12","PE":"2D6+12","PB":"1D4","Spd":"3D6+30"}', NULL, NULL, 'PE+2D4x10+50', '2D4x10', NULL, 'Race Lesser Demon. Also Known as The Bloodletters and Demon Guardians. Even the most dull-witted is a natural and cunning predator. Minimum speed 33 (22.5 mph/36 km). On S.D.C. worlds: 2D4x10+PE Hit Points, 1D6x10 S.D.C.; A.R. 11.', NULL, 13, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":4,"strike":5,"parry":6,"dodge":3,"pull":3,"disarm":5,"roll":1}', 'Impervious to Horror Factor. Knows all types of kick attacks. Supernatural P.S. Likes Brodkil.', 'Horsemanship (exotic animals); land navigation 70 percent; wilderness survival 90 percent; plus 2 skills from each of Military, Espionage, and Wilderness, all +10 percent', 'Fights untiring for 12 hours, leaps 20 ft, needs no air, eats spoiled food, climbs and swims well, tracks by blood scent, sees the invisible, dimensionally teleports, bio-regenerates, and turns into a fist-sized spider twice nightly.', 'Death Trance, Fear, plus Shatter, Magic Shield, and Fists of Fury; potency equal to a 3rd level sorcerer', NULL, '8-9 feet (2.4 to 2.7 m) tall', '300-400 pounds (135 to 180 kg)', 'Uncertain, 1000+ years; probably immortal', 'Woodlands, ruins, abandoned buildings, slums, and strange or ugly places throughout Rifts Russia, the Slavic Countries, China, and much of Asia; found almost anywhere, prefers the dark', 'Other Guardian Demons; other bloodthirsty creatures; greater demons and deities', 'All mortals, particularly humans; Warlords of Russia and their Camps (considered number one enemy by many); Bogatyrs; Demon Slayers; Mystic Kuznya; good practitioners of magic and psychics; Gargoyles', NULL, 'A tall, four-armed, clawed humanoid demon that craves combat, cannot resist a challenge, and serves as a savage guard or shock trooper for stronger demons.', 'Rifts World Book 18: Mystic Russia p.28-30');
  'midnight-demon', 'The Midnight Demon', 'demon', 'rifts', 0, 'Always miscreant or diabolic', '{"IQ":"1D6+13","ME":"1D6+13","MA":"1D6+13","PS":"1D6+13","PP":"1D6+13","PE":"1D6+13","PB":"1D6","Spd":"2D6+18"}', NULL, NULL, 'PE+2D4x10', '3D6x10+100', NULL, 'Race Lesser Archaic Demon. Also Known as the Black Mist and Dream Ghost. P.S. is half in daylight. Spd is floating/moving as mist; minimum speed 22 (15 mph/24 km). M.D.C. increases 50 percent between midnight and 3 a.m. On S.D.C. worlds: 1D6x10+PE Hit Points, 1D4x10 S.D.C., both +50 percent between midnight and 3 a.m.; A.R. 8 in imp form, not applicable as mist. Sees humans, other mortals, and sub-demons as playthings, not enemies.', NULL, 13, '{"attacks":4,"initiative":2,"strike":2,"parry":1,"dodge":1,"pull":3,"roll":4}', '+1 to save vs magic; +2 to save vs psionic attack; +4 to save vs illusions; +10 to save vs possession; +6 to save vs Horror Factor. Casting a spell counts as two melee actions. Supernatural P.S.', 'Land navigation 80 percent; wilderness survival 80 percent; streetwise 80 percent; seduction 50 percent', 'Floats tirelessly all night, prowls, climbs, sees in darkness and sees the invisible, dimensionally teleports, bio-regenerates, glides through cracks and under doors, and can turn into a black magpie once nightly.', 'See Aura, Sense Magic, Sense Evil, Death Trance, Fear, Fingers of the Wind, Levitation, Astral Projection, Ley Line Transmission, Calling, Sleep, Apparition, Compulsion, Spoil, Sickness, Shadow Meld, plus Federation of Magic spells Weight of Duty, Aura of Death, Aura of Doom, Mental Shock, Enemy Mind, Disharmonize, Id Alter Ego, Mindshatter, Soul Twist, Beat Insurmountable Odds, Distant Voice, Instill Knowledge, Superhuman Endurance, and Swap Places; potency equal to a 2nd level sorcerer by day, 4th at night, 6th between midnight and 3 a.m.', NULL, 'A mist about twice the size of a man', 'Insubstantial and ghost-like; effectively weightless', 'Uncertain, 2000+ years; probably immortal', 'Shuns humanity by day and most of the night; hunts mortal victims between midnight and 3 a.m.; most common in Rifts Russia, Mongolia, and China, but found throughout Western Europe, India, and Asia', 'Others of its kind; greater demons; dark gods; evil practitioners of magic; evil Mind Melters and Mind Bleeders; holds the Splugorth in high regard despite rivalry', 'Vampires (seen as rivals)', NULL, 'A shadowy mist-demon that appears only near midnight to manipulate victims fears and emotions into betrayal, despair, and tragedy.', 'Rifts World Book 18: Mystic Russia p.30-32');
  'nalet', 'The Nalet', 'demon', 'rifts', 0, 'Always miscreant or diabolic', '{"IQ":"1D6+8","ME":"1D6+8","MA":"2D6+8","PS":"4D6+16","PP":"2D6+16","PE":"2D6+8","PB":"1D6+8","Spd":"2D6+8"}', NULL, NULL, 'PE+2D6x10+36', '2D6x10+60+ME', NULL, 'Race Lesser Archaic Demon. Also Known as the Crimson Flyer and Blood Demon. Spd given is running; flying speed is 6D6+40, minimum speed 46 (32 mph/51 km). On S.D.C. worlds: 2D4x10+PE Hit Points, 1D6x10+20 S.D.C.; A.R. 14. The Unclean, Ilya, Kladovik, Demon Claw, Serpent Hound, and Hell Horse follow the Nalet as superiors.', NULL, 11, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":4,"strike":4,"parry":3,"dodge":2,"pull":6,"roll":2}', '+4 to dodge while in flight; +5 to save vs Horror Factor. Supernatural P.S. Will consider using modern energy weapons, though prefers melee weapons.', 'Horsemanship (exotic animals); land navigation 98 percent; navigation (flying/air) 80 percent; basic math 90 percent; seduction 70 percent; wilderness survival 80 percent; plus 4 skills from each of W.P. Ancient Weapons and Espionage, all +20 percent (one skill +10 percent more)', 'Runs or fights untiring for hours, leaps 20 ft, flies to 30,000 ft, hovers, climbs, swims, tracks and tails targets, breathes without air, dimensionally teleports, bio-regenerates, and can shrink to a third its size to spy unseen.', 'See Aura, See the Invisible, Sense Magic, Blinding Flash, Ignite Fire, Fuel Flame, Fire Bolt, Fire Ball, Circle of Flame, Wind Rush, Aura of Power, Fireblast, Fire Blossom, Fire Gout, and Lightblade; potency equal to a 4th level sorcerer', NULL, '10 feet (3 m) tall, plus horns and wings', '400 pounds (180 kg)', 'Uncertain, 2000+ years, but probably immortal', 'Especially common in Rifts Russia; found throughout the Slavic countries, China, and much of Asia, favoring the Steppe, grasslands, and mountains; encountered by day more than at night; also occasionally North America (Calgary and St. Louis Rifts)', 'Its own kind; other demons; greater demons; powerful practitioners of magic; other beings with agendas of combat, war, murder, torment, and mayhem', 'All mortals, particularly humans; True Atlanteans (old enemies); the Warlords and Sovietski warriors', NULL, 'A tall, winged, fire-hued demon warrior and cunning tactician who leads bands of lesser demons against human War Camps and delights in deceiving mortal allies.', 'Rifts World Book 18: Mystic Russia p.32-34');
  'serpent-hound', 'Serpent Hound', 'demon', 'rifts', 0, 'Always miscreant or diabolic', '{"IQ":"1D4+6","ME":"1D6+6","MA":"1D6+6","PS":"3D6+24","PP":"2D6+10","PE":"1D6+18","PB":"1D6","Spd":"2D6+20"}', NULL, NULL, 'PE+3D4x10', '3D4x10+66', NULL, 'PS half in daylight. Spd is running; flying Spd is 1D6x10+80. MDC/HP/SDC increase 50% at night or in darkness. On S.D.C. worlds: Hit Points 1D4x10+PE, S.D.C. 2D4x10, A.R. 13 day or night. Also known as the Fire Hound and Demon Hound. Its heading, alone among the eighteen demons, carries no NPC or Player Character tag.', NULL, 12, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":4,"strike":4,"parry":2,"dodge":4,"pull":3,"roll":3}', '+5 save vs Horror Factor; +2 save vs mind control, possession, and illusions; dodge rises to +6 while flying.', 'Land navigation 95%, navigation 90%, wilderness survival 90%; select 3 skills each from W.P. Ancient Weapons and Espionage (+15% each, one skill +15% more); proficiency in these does not advance.', 'Excellent, tireless speed (48 hrs); leaps 15 ft; climbs, swims, tracks by scent and sight; nightvision 1 mile; teleports 25%; regenerates 2D6 MD/round; prehensile tail; thermal/infrared vision; breathes fire; becomes a snake or elkhound twice daily.', 'Blinding Flash, Cloud of Smoke, Fuel Flame, Ignite Fires, Fire Bolt, Circle of Flame, Energy Disruption, Fire Ball, Call Lightning, Negate Magic, Dispel Magic Barrier, Reduce Self; plus Lantern Light, Light Blade, Fireblast, Fire Blossom, Fire Gout, Fire Globe (Federation of Magic). Potency equal to a 4th level sorcerer.', NULL, '5-6 ft tall at the shoulders, 3-4 ft wide, 15 ft long, 15 ft wingspan', '1000 lbs (450 kg)', 'Uncertain, 1000+ years; probably immortal', 'Western Europe, India, Russia, Mongolia, China, Asia, favoring forests and mountains; about 1000 have rifted to the northern Rockies and western Canada', 'Nalet; Unclean; Il''ya; Kladovik; greater demons; powerful practitioners of magic; own kind (packs of 3-6)', 'All mortals, especially the Warlords of Russia, their War Camps, Demon Slayers, and heroes; Gargoyles; Brodkil; vampires', NULL, 'A winged, serpent-bodied demon resembling a small dragon with a hound-like head; a loyal, fire-breathing minion serving stronger demons and evil sorcerers.', 'Rifts World Book 18: Mystic Russia p.40-41');
  'stone-demon', 'Stone Demon', 'demon', 'rifts', 0, 'Always miscreant or diabolic', '{"IQ":"1D6+5","ME":"1D6+5","MA":"1D6+5","PS":"2D6+40","PP":"2D6+10","PE":"2D6+18","PB":"1D6","Spd":"2D6+5"}', NULL, NULL, '2D4x10+200', '3D4x10+60', NULL, 'PS is half in water or in the air (draws power from the Earth; reduce PS and magic potency by half if not touching ground). On S.D.C. worlds: Hit Points 2D6x10, S.D.C. 140, A.R. 15 day and night. If its physical body is destroyed, 65% chance it is banished home for 3D6 months; it can also shed its body to hide within the specific stone it inhabits. Destroying that stone banishes it for 2D6x10 years.', NULL, 11, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":2,"strike":3,"parry":2,"dodge":1,"pull":4,"roll":3}', '+4 save vs Horror Factor.', 'Land navigation 95%, identify plants and fruits, prospecting, recognize weapon quality, military fortification, trap construction, trap/mine detection, whittling/sculpting, and basic math, all at 75%.', 'Slow but tireless; swims 30%; survives depths of 2 miles; nightvision 1 mile; teleports 30%; regenerates 4D6 MD/round while touching earth; senses minerals, quakes, and disturbances; can shed its body to hide in its bound stone.', 'Chameleon, Fool''s Gold, Repel Animals, Spoil (Food/Water), Sickness, Negate Poison, Stone to Flesh; plus Earth Warlock level 1-2 spells, Mend Stone, Crumble Stone, Earth Rumble, Wall of Stone, Wall of Thorns, Quicksand, Sand Storm, River of Lava, Earthquake, Travel through Walls, Travel Through Stone, Petrification; plus Federation of Magic spells. Potency equal to a 4th level sorcerer.', NULL, '6-16 ft (1.8 to 4.9 m) tall', '1-10 tons', 'Uncertain, 1000+ years; probably immortal', 'Wilderness throughout western Europe, India, Russia, Mongolia, China, and Asia; occasionally in a village', 'Own kind; other demons; greater demons; powerful practitioners of magic; evil warlocks; sometimes manipulates Elementals', 'All mortals, humans in general, and the Warlords and their War Camps in particular', NULL, 'A territorial earth spirit that forms a stone body from a mountain, cave, or ruin to punish anyone disturbing its domain.', 'Rifts World Book 18: Mystic Russia p.34-36');
  'water-demon', 'Water Demon', 'demon', 'rifts', 0, 'Always miscreant or diabolic', '{"IQ":"1D6+8","ME":"1D6+2","MA":"1D6+8","PS":"2D6+20","PP":"2D6+8","PE":"2D6+8","PB":"1D6+14","Spd":"2D6+8"}', NULL, NULL, '2D6x10+70', '3D4x10+60', NULL, 'PS is half in dry, hot environments. Spd on dry land is 2D6+8, but 2D6+60 in water (double when in serpent form). On S.D.C. worlds: Hit Points 2D6x10, S.D.C. 1D4x10+40, A.R. 12 day and night. If its physical body is destroyed, 65% chance it is banished home for 3D6 months; it can also hide in its deep-water lair. Destroying that lair banishes it for 2D6x10 years.', NULL, 9, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":2,"strike":3,"parry":2,"dodge":1,"pull":4,"roll":3}', '+1 save vs magic; +5 save vs Horror Factor; impervious to possession; dodge rises to +6 underwater.; +6 to dodge underwater', 'Astronomy, navigation, land navigation, basic math, boat building, pilot sail/row boats, brewing, chemistry, lore: demons and monsters, all at 86%; select two rogue skills (+20%).', 'Good, tireless speed; swims 98%; survives any depth; nightvision 1 mile; sees invisible; teleports 40%; regenerates 2D6 MD/round near water; senses tides and storms; dowses at triple range; becomes part serpent for speed and combat.', 'Globe of Daylight, Globe of Silence, Turn Dead, Energy Bolt, Float in Air, Seal, Escape, Water to Wine, Summon Fog, Summon Storm, Spoil (Food/Water), Negate Poison; plus Water Warlock level 1-2 spells, Command Fish, Calm Waters, Circle of Rain, Create Water, Earth to Mud, Whirlpool, Part Waters, Rain Dance, Summon Storm, Drought; plus Federation of Magic spells. Potency equal to a 5th level sorcerer.', NULL, '6-7 ft (1.8 to 2.1 m) tall', '200 lbs (90 kg)', 'Uncertain, 1000+ years; probably immortal', 'Wilderness throughout western Europe, India, Russia, Mongolia, China, Asia; occasionally North America', 'Own kind; other demons; greater demons; powerful practitioners of magic; sometimes manipulates Elementals; evil Water Warlocks and Woodland Spirits', 'All mortals, humans in general, and the Warlords and their War Camps in particular', NULL, 'A shapeshifting water spirit resembling a dark-haired woman who can turn part serpent; haunts swamps and waterways, punishing intruders and rivals.', 'Rifts World Book 18: Mystic Russia p.36-38');
  'wood-demon', 'Wood Demon', 'demon', 'rifts', 0, 'Always miscreant or diabolic', '{"IQ":"1D6+6","ME":"1D6+9","MA":"1D6+6","PS":"2D6+24","PP":"2D6+9","PE":"2D6+9","PB":"2D6","Spd":"2D6+9"}', NULL, NULL, '2D6x10+45', '3D4x10+40', NULL, 'MDC/HP/SDC increase 30% during the day (light of day energizes this demon and grants +1 attack). On S.D.C. worlds: Hit Points 2D6x10, S.D.C. 100. If either physical body (mobile form or sapling) is destroyed, 65% chance it is banished home for 3D6 months; it can also retreat into its bound tree. Destroying that tree banishes it for 2D6x10 years.', NULL, 10, '{"attacks":4,"initiative":2,"strike":3,"parry":4,"dodge":1,"pull":4,"roll":3}', '+2 save vs magic; +6 save vs Horror Factor; gains one extra attack during daylight.', 'Basic math, botany, carpentry, whittling/sculpting, holistic medicine, camouflage, detect traps, intelligence, farm lore, cattle/animals lore, all +80%; land navigation 65%, military fortification 50%, trap construction 45%, trap/mine detection 60%.', 'Slow but tireless (12 hrs); swims/floats 90%; does not breathe air; nightvision 2000 ft; teleports 30%; regenerates 3D6 MD/round while touching earth; senses plants, seismic activity, and weather; becomes a mobile wooden body or disguises as a sapling.', 'Earth and Air Warlock level 1 spells, plus Chameleon, Crumble Stone, Earth Rumble, Wall of Thorns, Wither Plants, Grow Plants, Repel Animals, Heavy Breathing, Howling Wind, Mesmerism, Whisper of the Wind, Leaf Rustler, Call Lightning, Suspended Animation; plus Federation of Magic spells. Potency equal to a 4th level sorcerer.', NULL, '8-12 ft (2.4 to 3.6 m) tall', '1-2 tons', 'Uncertain, 2000+ years; probably immortal', 'Wilderness throughout western Europe, India, Russia, Mongolia, China, Asia; occasionally a village', 'Own kind; other demons; greater demons; powerful practitioners of magic; evil warlocks; woodland spirits, Faerie Folk, druids, gypsies; especially compatible with Water Demons', 'All mortals, humans in general, and the Warlords and their War Camps in particular; vampires', NULL, 'A demonic spirit bound to a large or ancient tree that animates a gnarled wooden body to secretly torment woodsmen and travelers.', 'Rifts World Book 18: Mystic Russia p.38-40');
  'khitaka-abductors', 'Khitaka Abductors', 'demon', 'rifts', 0, 'Always miscreant or diabolic', '{"IQ":"1D6+9","ME":"1D6+10","MA":"1D6+11","PS":"3D6+30","PP":"2D6+12","PE":"2D6+12","PB":"1D6","Spd":"2D6+28"}', NULL, NULL, 'PE+5D6x10', '6D6x6+140', NULL, 'Minimum speed 30 (roughly 20 mph/32 km). MDC/HP/SDC increase 50% at night or in darkness; A.R. rises from 12 to 15 at night. On S.D.C. worlds: Hit Points 2D6x10, S.D.C. 2D6x10+20. Attacks per melee drop to four in daylight, which also dispels its disguises and invisibility.', NULL, 13, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":5,"strike":5,"parry":4,"dodge":3,"pull":8,"disarm":3,"roll":2}', '+6 save vs Horror Factor.', 'Land navigation 80%, wilderness survival 75%, horsemanship (general & exotic animals) 80%, surveillance systems (tailing) 86%, detect ambush 82%, detect concealment 80%, escape artist 70%, intelligence 75%, camouflage 75%; select three rogue skills (+20% each); two ancient and two modern W.P.s.', 'Fair, tireless speed; leaps 20 ft high, 30 ft long; climbs 98%/95%; swims 90%; survives depths of 1500 ft; tracks by scent/sight; sees invisible; nightvision 1 mile; teleports 55%; regenerates 3D6 MD/round; turns invisible at will; rides storms to fly.', 'Blinding Flash, Fire Bolt, See Aura, Sense Magic, Levitation, Magic Net, Carpet of Adhesion, Escape, Magic Pigeon, Calling, Purification, Spoil (Food/Water), Sickness, Chameleon, Shadow Meld, Mystic Portal, Teleport: Lesser, Teleport: Superior; plus Federation of Magic spells. Potency equal to a 5th level sorcerer.', NULL, '9-10 ft (2.7 to 3 m) tall', '700-900 lbs (315 to 405 kg)', 'Uncertain, 2000+ years; probably immortal', 'Anywhere throughout Rifts Russia, western Europe, China, Asia; from woodland hideaways to mansions or towers in cities and villages', 'Own kind; other demons; greater demons; Splugorth and their minions; powerful practitioners of magic', 'All mortals, particularly humans; Gargoyles; Brodkil; True Atlanteans and Temporal Raiders (old rivals)', NULL, 'A hulking, stealthy greater demon that kidnaps villagers for ransom, torture, or amusement, and sometimes rules a village as a tyrant.', 'Rifts World Book 18: Mystic Russia p.42-43');
  'nightfeeder', 'The Nightfeeder', 'demon', 'rifts', 0, 'Always diabolic; aggressive and cruel', '{"IQ":"1D4+7","ME":"1D6","MA":"1D6","PS":"2D6+30","PP":"2D6+12","PE":"2D6+12","PB":"1D4","Spd":"2D6+12"}', NULL, NULL, 'PE+3D4x10+42', '5D6x10+PE', NULL, 'PS is half in daylight. MDC/HP/SDC increase 50% at night or in darkness. On S.D.C. worlds: Hit Points 2D4x10+PE, S.D.C. 100. Light of day halves its PS and MDC and blocks metamorphosis.', NULL, 16, '{"attacks":8,"initiative":4,"strike":4,"parry":5,"dodge":2,"pull":7,"disarm":3,"roll":1}', '+8 save vs Horror Factor; casting a spell uses two of its eight attacks.', 'Horsemanship (general & exotic animals), land navigation 70%, wilderness survival 80%; select three skills each from W.P. Ancient Weapons and Rogue (+25% each, one skill +10% more); proficiency does not advance.', 'Fair, tireless speed; leaps 8 ft high, 12 ft long; climbs 80%/70%; swims 90%; survives depths of 2000 ft; nightvision 1 mile; sees invisible; teleports 55%; regenerates 4D6 MD/round; rides storms to fly; becomes an old man or hag nightly.; knows all languages 90%; limited invulnerability: impervious to ordinary S.D.C. weapons (silver, juniper and birch excepted)', 'Fool''s Gold, Multiple Image, Levitate, Mask of Deceit, Repel Animals, Compulsion, Spoil (Food/Water), Sickness, Shadow Meld, Cloak of Darkness; plus Federation of Magic spells. Potency equal to a 4th level sorcerer.', NULL, '6-7 ft (1.8 to 2.1 m) tall', '200-250 lbs (90 to 112.5 kg)', 'Uncertain, 2000+ years; probably immortal', 'Anywhere throughout Rifts Russia, China, and much of Asia; occasionally Poland, Germany, Africa, North America', 'Own kind; greater demons; powerful evil practitioners of magic; attracted to Necromancers and evil Shifters/Summoners', 'Humans (seen as playthings/prey); Demon Slayers, heroes, and mages; Gargoyles, Brodkil, sub-demons; vampires', NULL, 'A skinless, insect-armed greater demon that feeds on human flesh and delights in torturing and dominating whole communities.', 'Rifts World Book 18: Mystic Russia p.44-46');
  'koshchei-the-deathless-ones', 'Koshchei the Deathless Ones', 'demon', 'rifts', 0, 'Aberrant 55%, Miscreant 25%, Diabolic 15%, Anarchist 5%', '{"IQ":"1D6+16","ME":"1D6+16","MA":"1D6+20","PS":"3D6+32","PP":"1D6+16","PE":"1D6+16","PB":"1D6","Spd":"2D6+16"}', NULL, NULL, 'PE+6D6x10+16', '1D4x100+216', NULL, 'Also wears magical armor giving +160 MDC (on S.D.C. worlds: armor has 160 S.D.C. and A.R. 15) on top of body MDC. On S.D.C. worlds: Hit Points 3D6x10+PE, S.D.C. 3D6x10, natural A.R. 12. Conditional Immortality: destroying the body only banishes it for 72 hours; the Koshchei is permanently killed only by finding and cracking its hidden duck-egg soul vessel (2 S.D.C.). Believed to number fewer than 1000 across the Megaverse, at least 100 on Rifts Earth - this is a generic stat block for the KIND, not a single named individual.', NULL, 15, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":6,"strike":5,"parry":4,"dodge":4,"pull":6,"disarm":4,"roll":2}', '+2 save vs magic; +8 save vs mind control and illusions; +10 save vs possession; +10 save vs Horror Factor; may instead take two physical and two spell-casting attacks.', 'Horsemanship: knight and exotic animals, land navigation 70%, wilderness survival 75%, all Military and Espionage skills at 75%; W.P. Sword (8th level equivalent) plus five of choice (5th level equivalent).', 'Fair, tireless speed; leaps 20 ft high, 40 ft across; climbs 90%/85%; swims 90%; survives depths of 1000 ft; sees invisible; nightvision 1 mile; teleports 50%; regenerates 1D4x10 MD/round; conditionally immortal, reborn in 72 hours unless its soul-egg is found.; knows all languages 95%; limited invulnerability: impervious to ordinary S.D.C. weapons (silver, juniper and birch excepted)', 'Equivalent of an 8th level Mystic Kuznya (metal-working and weapon-making); plus See Aura, Sense Evil, Sense Magic, Detect Concealment, Turn Dead, Energy Disruption, Fly, Fly as the Eagle, Call Lightning, Fire Ball, Time Slip, Dispel Magic Barrier, Negate Magic, Spoil, Time Hole, Close Rift; plus Federation of Magic spells. Potency equal to a 6th level sorcerer.', NULL, '7 ft (1.8 m) tall', '200 lbs (90 kg)', 'Probably immortal', 'Anywhere throughout Europe and Asia, mainly Rifts Russia and Mongolia; 24 known active against the Warlords, another 76 scattered through Russia and Asia', 'Own kind; other Archaic demons (lesser and greater); dragons (held in high regard); dark gods; evil mortal servants (never treated as equals)', 'All mortals, particularly humans; the Warlords and their War Camps; Bogatyrs, Demon Slayers, and other heroes; vampires (mortal enemy above all others)', 'Effectively a Demon Knight', 'An elite, near-immortal demon knight-general whose soul hides in a duck''s egg; commands armies and forges enchanted weapons for chosen champions of evil.', 'Rifts World Book 18: Mystic Russia p.46-48');
  'morozko-frost-demons', 'Morozko Frost Demons', 'demon', 'rifts', 0, 'Anarchist 30%, Miscreant 30%, or any evil alignment', '{"IQ":"1D6+10","ME":"1D6+10","MA":"1D6+10","PS":"2D6+20","PP":"2D4+10","PE":"2D6+10","PB":"2D6","Spd":"2D6+12"}', NULL, NULL, 'PE+6D6x10', '1D4x100+50', NULL, 'Running speed triples when sliding on snow or ice, leaving no trail. Vulnerable to heat: above 60F, spell potency drops to 3rd level and MDC/Speed/Attacks are halved; normal fire becomes Mega-Damage against it (2D6 MD flaming weapon, 4D6 MD bonfire), and MD or magic fire does double damage. On S.D.C. worlds: Hit Points 2D6x10+PE, S.D.C. 3D6x10, A.R. 12. Can magically create a Frostblade (4D6 MD, 6D6 MD vs fire creatures/elementals). Old Man Morozko himself is a distinct named individual (12th level, 2000 MDC, anarchist, King of the Frost Demons) - not this generic row; see notable_npcs.', NULL, 13, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":3,"strike":4,"parry":4,"dodge":3,"pull":2,"disarm":2,"roll":1}', '+2 save vs magic; +6 save vs possession; +8 save vs Horror Factor.', 'Land navigation 60% (+30% in winter/snow), wilderness survival 85%, horsemanship: general and exotic (incl. Hell Horse), whittle/sculpt (ice only), art, dance, intelligence, all at 75%; select three skills from W.P./Wilderness/Technical (+20% each).', 'Fair, tireless speed; leaps 20 ft high, 30 ft across; swims 90%; skates 98%; survives depths of 1000 ft; sees invisible; nightvision 1 mile; teleports 40%; regenerates 3D6 MD/round; frost touch/breath attacks; invisible in snowstorms; rides storms to fly.; knows all languages 95%; impervious to cold and to ordinary S.D.C. weapons', 'Air & Water elemental spells (Conversion Book One), including Snow Storm, Hail, Shards of Ice, Sheet of Ice, Wall of Ice, Encase in Ice, Dowsing, and more; plus Federation of Magic spells including Orb of Cold, Wave of Cold, Frost Blade, Ice. Potency equal to a 6th level sorcerer.', NULL, '6-7 ft (1.8 to 2.1 m) tall', '300 lbs (135 kg)', 'Uncertain, 2000+ years; probably immortal', 'Anywhere throughout Europe, mainly Rifts Russia, Scandinavia, Mongolia, China, Asia', 'Own kind, especially Water Demons and Woodland Spirits; greater demons; dragons (high regard)', 'All mortals, particularly humans; the Warlords and their War Camps; vampires; Gargoyles and Brodkil; Kaluga Hags (hated)', NULL, 'A tall, ice-blue-skinned frost spirit serving the demon lord Old Man Morozko; wields cold magic and thrives through Russia''s long winters.', 'Rifts World Book 18: Mystic Russia p.48-50');
  'whirlwind-air-demons', 'Whirlwind Air Demons', 'demon', 'rifts', 0, 'Anarchist, miscreant, or diabolic; usually evil', '{"IQ":"1D6+7","ME":"2D6","MA":"2D6","PS":"3D6+20","PP":"1D6+17","PE":"1D6+17","PB":"1D6+7","Spd":"2D6+7"}', NULL, NULL, '5D6x10+70', '7D6x10+35', NULL, 'PB is 1D6+7 for males, 1D6+14 for females. Flying Spd is 2D6+88 (approx. 65 mph/104 km); ground Spd is 2D6+7. On S.D.C. worlds: Hit Points 4D4x10, S.D.C. 2D6x10, A.R. 11 day and night. In whirlwind form, physical attacks do no damage and most MD weapons only inflict 10%; MD explosives and particle beam weapons do half damage; the Vacuum spell dispels the form. Human disguise lasts up to 14 hours; whirlwind form up to 14 minutes.', NULL, 10, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":5,"strike":4,"parry":2,"dodge":2,"pull":2,"roll":3}', '+1 save vs magic; +5 save vs Horror Factor; +3 save vs possession; dodge rises to +6 while flying.; In whirlwind form only psionics, magic, elemental forces and explosives affect it: physical attacks do nothing, most M.D. weapons only 10%, M.D. explosives and particle beams half; the Vacuum spell dispels the whirlwind', 'Astronomy, navigation, land navigation, basic math, lore: demons and monsters, all at 91%; select two W.P. (4th level equivalent), two rogue, and two technical skills (+28% each).', 'Good, tireless speed (24 hrs); nightvision 2 miles; sees invisible; hawk-like vision spots targets 3 miles away; teleports 37%; regenerates 2D6 MD/round; senses wind and weather; becomes an attractive human or a literal whirlwind of destructive wind.; knows all languages 90%', 'All air elemental magic levels 1-8 (Conversion Book One); plus Cleanse, Lantern Light, Electric Arc, Wall of Wind, Heavy Air (Federation of Magic). Potency equal to a 5th level warlock.', NULL, '7-8 ft (2.1 to 2.4 m) tall', '200-400 lbs (90 to 180 kg)', 'Uncertain, 2000+ years; probably immortal', 'Worldwide, most common in Rifts Russia, Mongolia, China, Asia; fewer than 600 scattered through Canada, the US, and Mexico', 'Own kind; other demons, especially Nalet, Il''ya, Midnight Demons, and Wolf-Serpents; greater demons; powerful practitioners of magic', 'All mortals, humans in general, and the Warlords and their War Camps; Gargoyles, Brodkil, Demon Claws, Guardians, Kaluga Hags; Hindu and Chinese demons', NULL, 'A bullying, angel-like air demon that can dissolve into a swirling tornado; torments allies and enemies alike and abandons losing fights.', 'Rifts World Book 18: Mystic Russia p.50-53');
  'wolf-serpent', 'Wolf-Serpent', 'demon', 'rifts', 0, 'Always miscreant or diabolic', '{"IQ":"1D6+13","ME":"1D6+13","MA":"1D6+20","PS":"1D6+20","PP":"1D6+13","PE":"1D6+13","PB":"1D6","Spd":"2D6+20"}', NULL, NULL, '3D6x10+88', '1D4x100+130+PE', NULL, 'Speed doubles in wolf form. MDC/HP/SDC increase 30% at night or in darkness. On S.D.C. worlds: Hit Points 2D6x10+16, S.D.C. 100, A.R. 12 day or night. Combat form gives six attacks; wolf or snake form gives only four.', NULL, 14, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":3,"strike":3,"parry":2,"dodge":2,"pull":6,"roll":3}', '+3 save vs magic; +4 save vs illusions; +2 save vs Horror Factor; impervious to possession.', 'Land navigation 80%, wilderness survival 70%, basic math 98%, intelligence 90%, escape artist 80%, streetwise 85%, seduction 75%, all lore 75% each; select three skills each from W.P./Rogue/Science/Communications or Technical (+30% each).', 'Fair, tireless speed (12 hrs); climbs 85%/80%; swims 98%; survives depths of 1500 ft; nightvision 1 mile; teleports 45%; regenerates 1D6 MD/round; reads Russian and Dragonese/Elven; injects poison twice per round; becomes a rattlesnake or black wolf three times daily.; knows all languages 98%; limited invulnerability: impervious to ordinary S.D.C. weapons (silver, juniper and birch excepted)', 'All level one spells plus Second Sight, Oracle, Create Magic Scroll, Amulet, Sanctum, Charismatic Aura, Invisibility: Simple/Superior, Eyes of Thoth, Ley Line Transmission, Commune with Spirits, Negate Magic, Dispel Magic Barrier, Mystic Portal, Constrain Being, Banishment, Control/Enslave Entity, and more; plus Federation of Magic spells. Potency equal to a 6th level sorcerer at night, 4th level during the day.', NULL, 'Coiled with head at eye level; 25-30 ft (7.6 to 9.1 m) long', '600 lbs (315 kg)', 'Uncertain, 3000+ years; probably immortal', 'Anywhere throughout Rifts Russia, China, much of Asia; occasionally Poland, Germany, Africa, North America; keeps a secret lair plus a known public abode', 'Usually 2D4 lesser demons (Unclean, Il''ya, sub-demons) as henchmen; human and D-Bee criminal connections; mortal agents who serve willingly', 'All mortals, particularly humans and True Atlanteans; Gargoyles, Brodkil, sub-demons (seen as inferior); vampires; likes to trick and manipulate Whirlwind demons', NULL, 'A serpent-bodied demon with a wolf''s head that corrupts mortals with tempting, ruinous advice and always collects a hidden price.', 'Rifts World Book 18: Mystic Russia p.53-55');
  'domovoi', 'Domovoi', 'spirit', 'rifts', 1, 'Any, mostly unprincipled or anarchist', '{"IQ":"1D4+6","ME":"1D6+10","MA":"1D6+10","PS":"1D6+8","PP":"1D6+10","PE":"2D6+10","PB":"1D6+6","Spd":"2D6+10"}', NULL, NULL, 'PE+1D4x10', '6D6x2+PE', NULL, 'On S.D.C. worlds: Hit Points 3D6+PE, S.D.C. 4D6.', NULL, 9, '{"attacks":4,"initiative":3,"strike":1,"parry":2,"dodge":3,"pull":3,"roll":3}', '+6 save vs poison/disease, +2 save vs Horror Factor; in addition to attribute bonuses.', 'Horsemanship (general), land navigation 80%, wilderness survival 80%, plus 2 skills each from W.P. Ancient Weapons, Domestic, Technical (lore only), Wilderness, all +15% (skills do not advance).', 'Fair speed; leaps 6ft; prowls 70%, climbs 90/80%, swims 80%; holds breath 4+1D4 min; survives 300ft depth; tracks humanoids 50%, animals 60%; nightvision 300ft; bio-regenerates 1D4 MD/hr; sees invisible; turns invisible at will; limited metamorphosis into cat or dog.; knows all languages 75%', 'Chameleon, Sense Evil, Sense Magic, Repel Animals, Escape; plus (Federation of Magic) Lantern Light, Cleanse, Throwing Stones, Mystic Fulcrum, Mend the Broken, Influence the Beast, Life Source. Potency: 3rd level sorcerer.', NULL, 'Two feet (0.6 m) tall', '20-40 lbs (11.3-18 kg)', 'Uncertain, 1000+ years; may be immortal.', 'Occasionally grasslands/woodlands, but prefers farms, houses or small villages; adopts a family for generations.', 'Others of its kind; most other Woodland Spirits; other household members', 'Those who threaten it, its house, family or friends; demons and evil people, including fellow Woodland Spirits', NULL, 'A two-foot, fur-covered house guardian resembling a dwarf Sasquatch; it does chores for an adopted family and turns invisible, but punishes those who harm children in its care.', 'Rifts World Book 18: Mystic Russia p.57-59');
  'leshii', 'Leshii', 'spirit', 'rifts', 1, 'Any, mostly unprincipled or anarchist', '{"IQ":"1D4+8","ME":"1D6+8","MA":"1D6+8","PS":"2D6+30","PP":"1D6+14","PE":"2D6+14","PB":"1D6+6","Spd":"2D6+30"}', NULL, NULL, 'PE+4D4x10', '1D4x100+PE', 'MEx3', 'On S.D.C. worlds: Hit Points 2D4x10+PE, S.D.C. 2D4x10.', NULL, 12, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":3,"strike":4,"parry":2,"dodge":3,"pull":5,"roll":2}', '+2 save vs poison, +8 save vs disease, +4 save vs Horror Factor; in addition to attribute bonuses.', 'Horsemanship (knight and exotic animal), land navigation 98%, wilderness survival 98%, W.P. Blunt (5th level equiv.), all animal/farm/plant lore, plus 3 skills each from Domestic and Wilderness, all +35% (no advancement).', 'Good speed; leaps 15ft high, 20ft long; prowls 65%, climbs 90/85%, swims 80%; holds breath 6+1D6 min; survives 300ft depth; tracks humanoids 50% (+15% animal form), animals 90% (+5%); nightvision 600ft; impervious to cold; bio-regenerates 3D6 MD/hr.; knows all languages 70%', 'Blinding Flash, Thunderclap, Heavy Breathing, Fingers of the Wind, Chameleon, Shadow Meld, Reduce Self, all animal summoning spells; plus (Federation of Magic) Cleanse, Influence the Beast, Tame Beast. Potency: 5th level sorcerer.', 'ME x3 ISP: Mind Block, Dowsing, Resist Fatigue, Resist Hunger, Resist Thirst, Healing Touch.', '10-12 feet (3-3.6 m) tall', '600-1000 lbs (270-450 kg)', 'Uncertain, 1000+ years; may be immortal.', 'Northern and northwestern forests of Rifts Russia; rare in China/Asia, occasionally Scandinavia, Poland, Germany.', 'Others of its kind; most Woodland Spirits; Mega-Steeds; animals in general', 'Warlords and War Camps; most demons except Wood/Earth/Water; humans in general', NULL, 'A ten-foot, goat-legged forest giant with horns and a beard who protects wildlife, punishes despoilers with pranks or violence, and can shapeshift into animals or an old man.', 'Rifts World Book 18: Mystic Russia p.59-61');
  'polevoi', 'Polevoi', 'spirit', 'rifts', 1, 'Any, mostly anarchist, miscreant or unprincipled', '{"IQ":"1D4+9","ME":"1D6+7","MA":"1D6+7","PS":"2D6+20","PP":"1D6+16","PE":"2D6+16","PB":"1D6+9","Spd":"2D6+50"}', NULL, NULL, 'PE+2D4x10', '2D4x10+50', 'MEx2', 'Spd doubles during midday; MDC doubles during midday; on S.D.C. worlds: Hit Points 1D4x10+PE, S.D.C. 1D4x10 (also doubles during midday).', NULL, 9, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":4,"strike":3,"parry":2,"dodge":4,"pull":3,"roll":2}', '+3 save vs poison, +6 save vs disease, +5 save vs Horror Factor; in addition to attribute bonuses.', 'Horsemanship (knight and exotic animal), land navigation 90%, wilderness survival 95%, all animal/farm/plant lore, plus 3 skills each from W.P. (4th level equiv.), Rogue, Wilderness, all +25% (no advancement).', 'Fast; leaps 12ft high, 18ft long; prowls 55%, climbs 70/65%, swims 70%; holds breath 2+1D6 min; survives 300ft depth; tracks humanoids 50% (+15% animal), animals 70% (+15%); nightvision 100ft; impervious to cold; bio-regenerates 3D6 MD/hr.; knows all languages 70%', 'Globe of Daylight, Befuddle, Concealment, Detect Concealment, Fingers of the Wind, Chameleon, Reduce Self, Repel Animals, all level-1 Earth Warlock spells, Wither Plants, Grow Plants, Mend Stone, Travel Through Walls. Potency: 3rd level sorcerer (6th noon-3pm).', 'ME x2 ISP: Mind Block, Presence Sense, Impervious to Fire, Impervious to Poison, Telekinetic Push.', 'Males 4ft (1.2m); females 4ft to 4ft6in (1.2-1.3m)', '70-100 lbs (32-45 kg)', 'Uncertain, 1000+ years; may be immortal.', 'Steppe, grasslands, farmlands, fields of Russia, Poland; less common Mongolia/China plains; rarer than Domovoi or Leshii.', 'Others of its kind; most Woodland Spirits (defends them); occasionally farmers, huntsmen, heroes, maidens, children', 'Anyone who threatens or annoys them; Warlords and War Camps; most demons except Wood/Earth/Water; humans in general', NULL, 'A four-foot, earth-colored field spirit with grassy hair, armed with a sickle or scythe; bold, spiteful and easily provoked, and strongest at midday.', 'Rifts World Book 18: Mystic Russia p.61-63');
  'rusalka', 'Rusalka', 'spirit', 'rifts', 1, 'Any, mostly miscreant, anarchist or diabolic (evil)', '{"IQ":"1D4+7","ME":"1D6+7","MA":"1D6+14","PS":"2D6+21","PP":"1D6+14","PE":"2D6+14","PB":"1D6+14","Spd":"2D6+30"}', NULL, NULL, 'PE+2D4x10', '2D4x10+42', 'MEx2', 'MDC doubles between midnight and dawn; Spd doubles at night; on S.D.C. worlds: Hit Points 1D4x10+PE, S.D.C. 1D4x10 (also doubles late at night).', NULL, 10, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":3,"strike":4,"parry":3,"dodge":4,"pull":4,"roll":1}', '+7 save vs poison/disease, +7 save vs Horror Factor; in addition to attribute bonuses.', 'Horsemanship (general and exotic animal), land navigation 95%, wilderness survival 95%, acrobatics/gymnastics 95%, seduction 80%, dance 98%, plus 2 skills each from W.P. (4th level equiv.) and Rogue, all +30% (no advancement).', 'Fair to good speed; leaps 12ft high, 20ft long; swims like a fish 98%, breathes underwater, survives any depth; tracks humanoids 50%; climbs 95/95%; nightvision 1 mile; impervious to cold; bio-regenerates 1D6 MD/min.; knows all languages 80%', 'Befuddle, Concealment, Detect Concealment, Chameleon, Fingers of the Wind, Float in Air, Levitate, Ignite Fire, Fuel Flame, Fire Bolt, Invisibility: Simple, Energy Disruption, Impervious to Energy, Escape, Fly as the Eagle, Spoil, Water to Wine, Mask of Deceit. Potency: 3rd level sorcerer (6th midnight-dawn).', 'ME x2 ISP: Mind Block, Empathy, Sense Time, Empathic Transmission.', 'Six feet (1.8 m) tall; always appears as a beautiful woman', '100-150 lbs (45-67.5 kg)', 'Uncertain, 1000+ years; may be immortal.', 'Woodlands and riverbanks, lakes, streams, ponds, mills of the old Ukraine/southern Russia; less common in tundra, Mongolia, China.', 'Others of its kind; Kaluga Hags; Nalets (sometimes lovers); Morozko Frost Demons; Koshchei the Deathless Ones; Wolf-Serpents; witches and evil practitioners of magic', 'Anyone who threatens or opposes them; Warlords soldiers (seduced, robbed or slain); Water demons (jealous rivalry); beautiful women (envied and attacked)', NULL, 'A seductive, cruel air spirit resembling a beautiful maiden with long hair, who lures and often robs or kills mortal men, especially soldiers, and envies beautiful women.', 'Rifts World Book 18: Mystic Russia p.63-64');
  'vodianoi', 'Vodianoi', 'spirit', 'rifts', 1, 'Any, mostly miscreant, diabolic or anarchist (evil)', '{"IQ":"1D6+6","ME":"1D6+6","MA":"1D6+6","PS":"2D6+18","PP":"1D6+12","PE":"2D6+12","PB":"1D6+6","Spd":"2D6+6"}', NULL, NULL, 'PE+2D4x10', '2D4x10+60', 'MEx2', 'Dry-ground Spd increases 50% at night; swimming Spd 2D6+40 (+50% at night), minimum 30 mph/48 km swimming; MDC doubles at night; on S.D.C. worlds: Hit Points 1D4x10+PE, S.D.C. 1D6x10 (also double at night).', NULL, 12, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":3,"strike":3,"parry":3,"dodge":2,"pull":2,"roll":1}', 'Horror/Awe Factor is 7 for the rare good-aligned Vodianoi, 12 if evil (the majority); dodge doubles in water; +4 save vs poison/disease, +5 save vs Horror Factor; fire-based attacks do double damage.', 'Underwater and sea navigation 95%, wilderness survival 95%, plus 2 skills each from W.P. (4th level equiv.), Rogue, Wilderness, all +30% (no advancement).', 'Fair speed on land, amazing swimming; swims 98% (faster than fish); dives 1000ft, breathes underwater, survives any depth; climbs 60/50%; sees in murky water and infrared; nightvision 1 mile; impervious to cold; bio-regenerates 2D6 MD/min.; knows all languages 80%', 'All level 1-2 Water Elemental spells (Conversion Book One), Create Water, Command Fish, Summon Sharks and Whales, Summon Storm, Drought. Potency: 3rd level sorcerer by day, 5th at night.', 'ME x2 ISP: Mind Block, Exorcism, Telepathy, Hydrokinesis.', 'Males 4-5ft (1.2-1.5m) potbellied; females 5-6ft (1.5-1.8m) thin', '150-250 lbs (67.5-76 kg)', 'Uncertain, 1000+ years; may be immortal.', 'Swamps, ponds, mill ponds, lakes, rivers, seas of Russia, Mongolia, parts of Asia; rarely lives in the city proper.', 'Others of its kind; some demons; wicked Woodland Spirits and people; Leshii; Nalets; Morozko Frost Demons; Serpent Hounds; Demon Claws; Stone, Wood and Water Demons', 'Anyone who threatens or opposes them; Warlords troops (frequent targets); fishermen and sailors who stray from the group', NULL, 'A treacherous water spirit resembling a bloated, slimy old man with wolf-paw hands; drowns and torments travelers and hoards sunken treasure at the bottom of lakes and rivers.', 'Rifts World Book 18: Mystic Russia p.64-66');
  'firebird', 'Firebird', 'spirit', 'rifts', 0, 'Any selfish or good', '{"IQ":"1D4+2","ME":"1D6+10","MA":"1D6+20","PS":"1D6+6","PP":"1D6+10","PE":"1D6+10","PB":"1D6+20","Spd":"2D6+6"}', NULL, NULL, 'PE+1D4x10', '1D4x100', 'MEx10', 'Flying Spd 1D6x10+100; on S.D.C. worlds: Hit Points 3D6+PE, S.D.C. 4D6; PPE doubles during a blood sacrifice.', NULL, 9, '{"attacks":3,"initiative":5,"dodge":4,"roll":1}', '+7 dodge when flying, +7 save vs poison/disease, +3 save vs Horror Factor; in addition to attribute bonuses.', 'Land and air navigation 98%, wilderness survival 88%.', 'Excellent flyer; flies or sings 12hrs without rest; prowls 60%, climbs 70/50%, swims 50%; keen vision and hearing; sees invisible; bio-regenerates 1D6 MD/hr; may understand all languages (60%); metamorphoses into pheasant or hummingbird to hide its light up to 6hrs/day.; knows all languages 60% (perhaps)', 'Sense Evil, Sense Magic, Blinding Flash, Repel Animals, Resist Fire, Negate Poison, Turn Dead. Potency: 3rd level sorcerer.', 'ME x10 ISP: Healing Touch, Increased Healing, Suppress Fear, Empathy, Mind Block.', 'About 2ft (0.6m) long, 1ft (0.3m) tall', '12-20 lbs (5.4-9 kg); tastes fabulous', 'Uncertain, at least 500 years; maybe 1000+.', 'Scattered through Rifts Russia (approx. 100-200) and India/Asia (approx. 100-200); fewer than 400 exist worldwide.', 'Others of its kind; Old Believers; most champions of good; other Woodland Spirits (mutual protection)', 'Demons; Necromancers; unscrupulous, greedy and evil people', NULL, 'A rare, pheasant-sized golden bird whose glowing feathers repel vampires and light the dark; its feathers and blood are hugely valuable to sorcerers and Necromancers.', 'Rifts World Book 18: Mystic Russia p.66-68');
  'spirit-wolf', 'Spirit Wolf', 'spirit', 'rifts', 1, 'Any, mostly anarchist, unprincipled, aberrant or miscreant', '{"IQ":"1D6+6","ME":"1D6+18","MA":"1D6+8","PS":"2D6+18","PP":"1D6+18","PE":"1D6+18","PB":"1D6+18","Spd":"3D6+118"}', NULL, NULL, '6D6x3', '3D4x10+PE', 'MEx2', 'Minimum speed 82 mph (131 km); swimming speed is half; on S.D.C. worlds: Hit Points 3D4x3+PE, S.D.C. 1D6x10; A.R. 12 day and night; electrical attacks do double damage; silver S.D.C. weapons inflict M.D.', NULL, 10, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":3,"strike":3,"parry":1,"dodge":4,"pull":3,"roll":1}', 'Dodge doubles when running faster than 60 mph; +6 save vs poison/disease, +5 save vs Horror Factor; in addition to attribute bonuses.', 'Land navigation 90%, wilderness survival 95%, intelligence 80%, surveillance (tailing only) 80%, prowl 70%, streetwise 65%, plus 2 skills each from W.P. (4th level equiv.), Rogue, Wilderness, all +20% (no advancement).', 'Great speed; runs 72hrs without rest; leaps 20ft high, 30ft long; swims 85%, dives 300ft, holds breath 3D4+6 min (max depth 500ft); climbs 60/50%; tracks by scent 75%; nightvision 1 mile; impervious to cold; bio-regenerates 2D6 MD/min.; knows all languages 85%', 'See the Invisible, Sense Magic, Sense Evil, Globe of Daylight, Chameleon, Shadow Meld, Locate, Repel Animals, Escape. Potency: 3rd level sorcerer.', 'ME x2 ISP: Mind Block, Exorcism, Telepathy, Hydrokinesis.', 'Stands 4ft (1.2m) at the shoulders', '150-250 lbs (67.5-76 kg)', 'Uncertain, 1000+ years; may be immortal.', 'Forests and grasslands of Rifts Russia and Asia; avoids large cities, bored by small villages or farms.', 'Other people, especially humans; other Woodland Spirits; seldom fellow Spirit Wolves; sometimes demons, bandits or other unsavory forces', 'Anyone who threatens or opposes them; those who attack it first', NULL, 'A cunning spirit that looks like an ordinary grey wolf; it befriends travelers or villages for a time, then wanders off, and can pass as a hairy human.', 'Rifts World Book 18: Mystic Russia p.68-69');
  'man-wolf', 'Man-Wolf', 'spirit', 'rifts', 1, 'Any, mostly unprincipled, anarchist or miscreant', '{"IQ":"3D6","ME":"3D6","MA":"3D6","PS":"3D6+28","PP":"3D6+13","PE":"3D6+13","PB":"3D6","Spd":"3D6+50"}', NULL, NULL, 'PEx2+1D6x10', '2D4x10', 'MEx2', 'MDC increases 50% at night in wolf form; the Devil-Wolf variant gets +3D6 MDC; Attacks Per Melee is 5 as a wolf, 6 if a Devil-Wolf; on S.D.C. worlds: Hit Points 2D4x10, S.D.C. 1D6x10 (also +50% at night); A.R. 12 at night in wolf form, A.R. 6 as a human.', NULL, 12, '{"attacks":3,"initiative":3,"strike":3,"parry":2,"dodge":3,"pull":1,"roll":1}', 'Dodge doubles when running in wolf form; +7 save vs poison/disease, +8 save vs possession, +2 save vs mind control, +4 save vs Horror Factor (+6 if Devil-Wolf NPC); silver S.D.C. weapons do double M.D., Millennium Tree weapons do double damage.', 'Land navigation 95%, wilderness survival 90%, plus 3 skills each from W.P., Domestic, Technical, and Wilderness or Rogue, all +15% (-30% in wolf form); selected skills increase by level. Level of Experience: NPCs are 1D4+2; player characters start at 1st level, using the Dragon Hatchling XP table.', 'Good-excellent speed; runs 12hrs without rest; leaps 12ft high, 18ft long; poor swimmer (45%); climbs 60/50%; tracks by scent 85% (-50% as human); nightvision 1 mile (-80% human form); sees invisible; impervious to cold; bio-regenerates 2D6 MD/hr.; knows all languages 85%', NULL, 'ME x2 ISP: Intuitive Combat, Empathy, Commune with Spirits, Object Read, Sense Time, Sense Evil, Sixth Sense, Mind Block.', '5ft (1.5m) at the shoulders, eye-level about 6ft (1.8m)', '250 lbs (76kg) as a wolf; average human weight in human form', 'Adds 3D6x10 years to the life of a human.', 'Anywhere in Rifts Russia, Mongolia, Hungary, Romania, Bulgaria, Poland, especially forest and mountain regions.', 'Others of its kind; werebeasts; demons; Woodland Spirits; Devil-Wolves typically associate only with evil Woodland Spirits, demons and witches', 'Anyone who threatens them; Devil-Wolves hate humans and beauty; many hate the Warlords and their Camps', NULL, 'A cursed human or D-Bee who involuntarily becomes a wolf-beast each night; most are tormented loners, though the cruel become murderous Devil-Wolves.', 'Rifts World Book 18: Mystic Russia p.69-71');



-- Read the result back. This script asserts its OWN rows and nothing else.
SELECT 'all 26 creatures are in' AS assertion, count(*) AS got, 26 AS want
  FROM creatures WHERE slug IN ('unclean-demon', 'demon-claw', 'hell-horse-demon', 'ilya-demon', 'kaluga-hag', 'kladovik-guardian-demon', 'midnight-demon', 'nalet', 'serpent-hound', 'stone-demon', 'water-demon', 'wood-demon', 'khitaka-abductors', 'nightfeeder', 'koshchei-the-deathless-ones', 'morozko-frost-demons', 'whirlwind-air-demons', 'wolf-serpent', 'domovoi', 'leshii', 'polevoi', 'rusalka', 'vodianoi', 'firebird', 'spirit-wolf', 'man-wolf');
SELECT 'and their 71 attacks' AS assertion, count(*) AS got, 71 AS want
  FROM stat_attacks WHERE owner_kind = 'creature' AND owner_slug IN ('unclean-demon', 'demon-claw', 'hell-horse-demon', 'ilya-demon', 'kaluga-hag', 'kladovik-guardian-demon', 'midnight-demon', 'nalet', 'serpent-hound', 'stone-demon', 'water-demon', 'wood-demon', 'khitaka-abductors', 'nightfeeder', 'koshchei-the-deathless-ones', 'morozko-frost-demons', 'whirlwind-air-demons', 'wolf-serpent', 'domovoi', 'leshii', 'polevoi', 'rusalka', 'vodianoi', 'firebird', 'spirit-wolf', 'man-wolf');

